  displayText: "The Faceless Stalker\n\n\nSigurd's danger level: 90%\n\nScientific name: Stalkerus No-Faceus\n\nThere's no scientific record on this entity, though the scan suggest that it haunts only one individual at a time. \nDue to its appearance we just call it the Faceless Stalker, as it seems to stalk its prey over time. Aside from leaving the planet, there does not seem to be any way of getting rid of it permanently, so best keep it at a distance somehow... \nYou probably won't want it to creep too close to you."
